#### Decision Variables

- $x_i \geq 0$ for all $i \in \mathcal{P}$

#### Objective Function

\[
\max \sum_{i \in \mathcal{P}} p_i x_i
\]
where $p_i$ is the Unit_Profit for product $i$.

#### Device Capacity Constraints

For each device $j \in \mathcal{D}$:
\[
\sum_{i \in \mathcal{P}} a_{ji} x_i \leq c_j
\]
